<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>HackWell | Notes & Articles</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0d1117;
      --panel: #121b26;
      --panel-alt: #172332;
      --text: #edf6ff;
      --muted: #b2c1cd;
      --line: rgba(139, 233, 253, 0.18);
      --accent: #8be9fd;
      --highlight: #c8ff9d;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Inter, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .wrap {
      width: min(1000px, calc(100% - 2rem));
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .site-header {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: rgba(13, 17, 23, 0.88);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .header-inner {
      min-height: 72px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .brand {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--highlight);
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    }

    .back-link {
      color: var(--muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 0.55rem 0.8rem;
    }

    .page {
      padding: 4rem 0 3rem;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
      font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
      letter-spacing: -0.07em;
    }

    .subtitle {
      color: var(--muted);
      margin: 0 0 2rem;
      max-width: 600px;
    }

    .post-list {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .post-card {
      display: block;
      padding: 1.3rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px;
      text-decoration: none;
      background: var(--panel);
      transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .post-card:hover,
    .post-card:focus-visible {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      border-color: rgba(139, 233, 253, 0.45);
    }

    .meta {
      display: inline-block;
      color: var(--highlight);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    }

    .post-card h2 {
      margin: 0 0 0.55rem;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }

    .post-card p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .site-footer {
      padding: 2rem 0 2.5rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .footer-inner {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .site-footer a {
      color: var(--text);
      text-decoration: none;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="wrap header-inner">
      <a href="/" class="brand">hackwell</a>
      <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back home</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="page">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Notes & Articles</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">This section contains the writing that is not tied to specific platform walkthroughs. It is kept in Markdown so it is easy to import into Notion or reuse elsewhere.</p>

      <div class="post-list">
        <a class="post-card" href="/posts/learn-by-doing.md">
          <span class="meta">Personal note</span>
          <h2>Learn by Doing</h2>
          <p>Why I document my learning and how practicing in public helps me stay consistent.</p>
        </a>

        <a class="post-card" href="/posts/security-ethics.md">
          <span class="meta">Reflection</span>
          <h2>Ethics in Security</h2>
          <p>On responsible practice, curiosity, and the role of integrity in technical work.</p>
        </a>

        <a class="post-card" href="/posts/certification-notes.md">
          <span class="meta">Learning</span>
          <h2>Certification Notes</h2>
          <p>Study habits and practical reminders for building momentum through certifications.</p>
        </a>

        <a class="post-card" href="/posts/knowledge-system.md">
          <span class="meta">Process</span>
          <h2>Building a Knowledge System</h2>
          <p>How I keep notes useful, searchable, and easy to revisit years later.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="wrap footer-inner">
      <p>© 2026 HackWell</p>
      <p><a href="https://github.com/hakwell">GitHub</a></p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
